{"version":1,"content":"<p>任天堂旗下《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》重製版繼續刷新市場表現。在發售前，業界普遍認為這款經典作品的重製版將獲得成功，而遊戲上市後的表現也印證了這一判斷。數據顯示，該作在發售僅四天時間內銷量便突破520萬份，成為今年遊戲市場最受關注的作品之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586786.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:53:27.475403+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:40:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:46.909577+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:46.909577+00:00","content_hash":"867f32f8a2d77d552e077f25b5c3e3d6696f5ba8f3286b7202b4479c50ea054a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}